<p begin="00:18:28.903" end="00:18:31.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.905" end="00:20:33.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.707" end="00:24:38.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.309" end="00:26:41.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
